{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openapikit\/resolveddocument"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@dynamicMemberLookup"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResolvedDocument"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenAPI documents have two distinct forms of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distributing information such that not all relevant"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bits of information are available in one structural"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"part of an OpenAPI Document."}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Documents can contain references. This is great","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"because authors can make one part of an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenAPI document more concise by referencing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a component instead of writing it inline and it also","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"allows shared definitions to be re-used throughout","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the document.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Documents can define and override certain things at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"different levels of their structure. For example, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document may define a shared set of Security"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Requirements at the root and then override those"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Security Requirements for particular Operations."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both of these features of OpenAPI documents make it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"impossible to answer certain questions about a particular"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"route or endpoint without looking to multiple disparate parts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the document and then applying certain rules to determine"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the relevant semantic definition of the route or endpoint being"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"studied."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OpenAPIKit defines canonical forms (i.e. the only true definitions)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of endpoints, routes, and the whole document. These types (named","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"ResolvedEndpoint","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"ResolvedRoute","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"ResolvedDocument","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each allow you to get complete information about the respective components","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without looking to other parts of the document.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Example","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You want to know what all of the parameters for a particular "},{"code":"PATCH","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" endpoint are."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Without the "},{"code":"ResolvedEndpoint","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" type, you would need to look at the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"OpenAPI.Operation","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" representing the endpoint, the "},{"code":"OpenAPI.PathItem","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"representing the route containing the endpoint, and you would need to potentially"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resolve references to the "},{"code":"OpenAPI.Components","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"With ","type":"text"},{"code":"ResolvedDocument","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the same task is much simpler:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["let document: OpenAPI.Document = ...","","let resolvedDocument = try document","    .locallyDereferenced()","    .resolved()","","let endpoint = resolvedDocument","    .routesByPath[\"\/example\/path\"]!.patch!","","\/\/ This will be all parameters defined anywhere that","\/\/ apply to this endpoint:","let parameters = endpoint.parameters"]}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:10OpenAPIKit16ResolvedDocumentV","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResolvedDocument"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenAPIKit"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","title":"ResolvedDocument","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResolvedDocument","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/ResolvedDocument"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A resolved document is a fully dereferenced"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenAPI document that has been further distilled"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to canonical representations of each component. You"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"create a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ResolvedDocument"},{"type":"text","text":" by calling the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"resolved()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method on a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DereferencedDocument"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/SQ"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/ResolvedDocument\/endpoints","doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/ResolvedDocument\/paths","doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/ResolvedDocument\/routes","doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/ResolvedDocument\/routesByPath","doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/ResolvedDocument\/security","doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/ResolvedDocument\/underlyingDocument"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/ResolvedDocument\/subscript(dynamicMember:)"],"title":"Subscripts","anchor":"Subscripts"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/ResolvedDocument\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"references":{"doc://OpenAPIKit/documentation/OpenAPIKit/ResolvedDocument":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResolvedDocument","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ResolvedDocument","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/ResolvedDocument","title":"ResolvedDocument","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A resolved document is a fully dereferenced"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenAPI document that has been further distilled"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to canonical representations of each component. You"},{"type"